      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعِيلٌ</span></b>  The <i>like of stars, at the bottom of a
cooking-pot;</i> and <i>in tinder,</i> or <i>burnt rag into
which fire has fallen.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, O, TA.) ― 
